{"id":"CH-Profiling","title":"21. 性能分析、监控与性能优化","html":"<div class=\"sect1\"> <h2 id=\"CH-Profiling\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"CH-Profiling\" href=\"#CH-Profiling\">21. 性能分析、监控与性能优化</a></h2> <div class=\"sectionbody\"> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>“先让它能跑起来，再让它变漂亮，然后如果你真的、真的非做不可，再让它变快。90% 的情况下，只要你能把它写漂亮，它本来就已经够快了。”——Joe Armstrong</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>性能优化是构建健壮且可扩展系统的关键环节。理解底层的执行模型与内存管理策略，对于定位瓶颈和提升系统性能至关重要。本章将探讨性能分析工具、监控技术以及优化策略，帮助你构建高性能的 Erlang 和 Elixir 应用程序。</p> </div> <div class=\"sect2\"> <h3 id=\"_fundamentals_of_beam_performance\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_fundamentals_of_beam_performance\" href=\"#_fundamentals_of_beam_performance\">21.1. BEAM 性能基础</a></h3> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>让我们快速回顾一下本书到目前为止涉及的一些关键概念。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>BEAM 的性能从根本上取决于它的执行模型，而该模型是为高并发、容错系统而设计的。BEAM 虚拟机采用面向进程的模型运行，每个 Erlang 进程都独立运行，拥有自己隔离的堆。这种设计把进程之间的争用降到最低，但也带来了一些性能上的取舍，在内存使用和消息传递方面尤其明显。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>BEAM 中的执行以归约为单位来组织，归约代表一个进程所执行的工作量。每个进程在被抢占、让位于其他进程之前，会被分配一定数量的归约，从而确保所有执行实体都能得到公平调度。调度器本身是为多核效率而设计的，通常每个 CPU 核心运行一个调度器。调度器之间的负载均衡是动态处理的，工作窃取策略有助于维持利用率均衡。时间轮负责管理定时操作，让超时和延迟消息得到高效处理，而不会带来过高的 CPU 开销。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>BEAM 中的进程间通信遵循异步消息传递模型。由于进程之间不共享内存，消息会从一个进程的堆复制到另一个进程的堆，除非启用了共享二进制等特定优化。在高频消息传递的场景下，这可能导致效率低下。端口作为与外部系统交互的接口，依赖异步通信机制来避免阻塞调度器。当需要与 BEAM 运行时之外的 I/O 密集型或计算密集型操作对接时，这一点尤为关键。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>BEAM 的内存管理围绕每个进程私有的堆构建。这种方式把加锁降到最低，但要求精心设计垃圾回收策略。每个进程都运行一个分代垃圾回收器，它能高效回收短生命周期数据，同时让长生命周期数据继续留存。大型二进制单独放在共享堆中管理，以避免不必要的重复复制，但如果处理不当，就可能导致内存碎片化。ETS（Erlang Term Storage）表为共享数据存储提供了另一种选择，不过对 ETS 的操作会涉及项（term）复制，在高吞吐应用中可能带来额外开销。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>BEAM 中的数据结构遵循不可变设计，这意味着对元组和映射的更新会复制数据，而不是原地修改。这种「更新即复制」的行为保证了安全性，但在频繁修改大型结构时代价可能很高。要针对 BEAM 做性能优化，就要以尽量减少不必要复制的方式来组织数据，并为不同的访问模式选用合适的存储机制。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect2\"> <h3 id=\"_profiling_tools\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_profiling_tools\" href=\"#_profiling_tools\">21.2. 性能分析工具</a></h3> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>BEAM 自带一组内置的性能分析器（profiler），让你能够查看时间究竟花在哪里——推而广之，也就是性能问题藏在哪里。此外还有一些像 redbug 和 recon 这样的外部工具可用于性能分析。每种工具都有自己的长处与取舍。</p> </div> <div class=\"sect3\"> <h4 id=\"_fprof\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_fprof\" href=\"#_fprof\">21.2.1. <code>fprof</code></a></h4> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p><code>fprof</code> 工具是一个基于跟踪的性能分析器，它会对你的代码进行插桩，以捕获带有时序信息的详细调用图。它会收集每一次函数调用，然后在单独的后处理步骤中，把海量跟踪数据转换成易于阅读的报告。如果你不仅想知道哪些函数慢，还想了解它们是如何嵌套调用的，<code>fprof</code> 能给你完整答案。缺点呢？它的开销可能相当大，因此最好用在隔离的测试场景中，而不是直接用在线上系统上。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect3\"> <h4 id=\"_eprof\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_eprof\" href=\"#_eprof\">21.2.2. <code>eprof</code></a></h4> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>工具 <code>eprof</code> 侧重于测量执行时间，而不是逐次记录每一次调用。通过对运行中的系统进行采样，它能给出各函数执行耗时的汇总视图。<code>eprof</code> 在细节与开销之间取得了很好的平衡；其报告会突出代码中的热点，又不会像 <code>fprof</code> 那样产生铺天盖地的数据。因此它非常适合用来快速做一轮性能排查。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect3\"> <h4 id=\"_cprof\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_cprof\" href=\"#_cprof\">21.2.3. <code>cprof</code></a></h4> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>工具 <code>cprof</code> 采用统计方法，在一段时间内对函数调用进行采样。<code>cprof</code> 不会生成完整的调用图，而是通过聚合数据来定位应用程序中的“热点”。它也许无法告诉你执行路径上的每一个曲折细节，却非常适合从宏观上弄清大部分处理时间究竟花在哪里。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect3\"> <h4 id=\"_tprof\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_tprof\" href=\"#_tprof\">21.2.4. <code>tprof</code></a></h4> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>工具 <code>tprof</code>（常被视为跟踪式性能分析器）利用了 Erlang 内置的跟踪能力。通过设置跟踪标志，它能以比全面插桩侵入性更低的方式收集性能数据。生成的报告还可以再做后处理，从而同时揭示时间信息和调用关系。当你需要分析长时间运行或仍在线上运行的进程时，这个工具尤其有用，只不过它的配置步骤要复杂一些。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect3\"> <h4 id=\"_recon_and_redbug\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_recon_and_redbug\" href=\"#_recon_and_redbug\">21.2.5. Recon 与 Redbug</a></h4> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>Recon 和 redbug 是社区驱动的库，在运行时诊断方面威力十足。两者都针对真实生产环境而设计，而且足够轻量，可以直接放入生产系统进行按需排障。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect3\"> <h4 id=\"_observer\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_observer\" href=\"#_observer\">21.2.6. Observer</a></h4> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>Observer 是 Erlang/OTP 自带的图形用户界面，它能让你实时地、从宏观上俯视整个系统。它以直观的方式可视化进程层级结构、消息队列和各项性能指标。我们在 <a data-ref=\"_using_observer_to_inspect_processes\" href=\"#_using_observer_to_inspect_processes\">第 3.1.3 节</a> 中对 Observer 做了简要介绍。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>尽管它会带来一些额外开销（因此通常不用于持续不断的生产环境性能分析），但 Observer 在交互式调试以及理解应用程序整体架构方面极具价值。它能够下钻到单个进程进行观察，这正好补充了分析器提供的更细粒度的洞察。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect3\"> <h4 id=\"_a_profiling_scenario\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_a_profiling_scenario\" href=\"#_a_profiling_scenario\">21.2.7. 一个性能分析场景</a></h4> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>我们来设想这样一个场景：某个 Erlang 应用明显变慢了，你怀疑问题出在某个模块上。在我们的示例中，有一个模块里的函数通过调用递归函数来处理列表，我们想定位时间究竟花在哪里。这只是一个非常简单的场景，只包含一个递归的阶乘函数，但它能帮助我们理解如何用各种性能分析工具来诊断性能问题。</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"ni\">module</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">).</span>\n<span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"ni\">export</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"n\">compute</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">eprof</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">tprof_example</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]).</span>\n\n<span class=\"nf\">compute</span><span class=\"p\">([])</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">ok</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"nf\">compute</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"nv\">H</span><span class=\"p\">|</span><span class=\"nv\">T</span><span class=\"p\">])</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">_</span><span class=\"nv\">F</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nf\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">H</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n    <span class=\"nf\">compute</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">T</span><span class=\"p\">).</span>\n\n<span class=\"nf\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"nf\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">N</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">when</span> <span class=\"nv\">N</span> <span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"nv\">N</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"nf\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">N</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">).</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"nf\">eprof</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"nv\">Compute</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nn\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">compute</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">15</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">25</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">])</span> <span class=\"k\">end</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"nn\">eprof</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">profile</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">Compute</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n    <span class=\"nn\">eprof</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">analyze</span><span class=\"p\">().</span>\n\n<span class=\"nf\">tprof_example</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">Type</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"nv\">Compute</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nn\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">compute</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">15</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">25</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">])</span> <span class=\"k\">end</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"nn\">tprof</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">profile</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">Compute</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"err\">#</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">type</span> <span class=\"o\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"nv\">Type</span><span class=\"p\">}).</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>在生产环境中，你发现处理一个中等长度的列表就会让系统出现延迟。你怀疑对 <code>factorial/1</code> 的反复递归调用消耗了过多归约，进而造成 CPU 争用。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>下面概述每个工具能提供什么帮助，并附上用法示例和示例结果。</p> </div> <div class=\"sect4\"> <h5 id=\"_fprof_example\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_fprof_example\" href=\"#_fprof_example\"><code>fprof</code> 示例</a></h5> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>借助 <code>fprof</code>，我们可以跟踪每一次函数调用，并构建出带有耗时细节的完整调用图。这让我们能够全面了解调用的嵌套关系和执行时间，但代价是开销很高。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>在 Erlang shell 中运行：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"nn\">fprof</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">apply</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"nn\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">compute</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"p\">[[</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">15</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">25</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">]]).</span>\n<span class=\"n\">ok</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"nn\">fprof</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">profile</span><span class=\"p\">().</span>\n<span class=\"nv\">Reading</span> <span class=\"nb\">trace</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">...</span>\n\n<span class=\"nv\">End</span> <span class=\"k\">of</span> <span class=\"nb\">trace</span><span class=\"o\">!</span>\n<span class=\"n\">ok</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"nn\">fprof</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">analyse</span><span class=\"p\">().</span>\n<span class=\"nv\">Processing</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">...</span>\n<span class=\"nv\">Creating</span> <span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">...</span>\n<span class=\"c\">%% Analysis results:\n</span><span class=\"p\">{</span>  <span class=\"n\">analysis_options</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n <span class=\"p\">[{</span><span class=\"n\">callers</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">true</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">sort</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">acc</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">totals</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">false</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">details</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">true</span><span class=\"p\">}]}.</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\">%                                               CNT       ACC       OWN\n</span><span class=\"p\">[{</span> <span class=\"n\">totals</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>                                      <span class=\"mi\">113</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">259</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">259</span><span class=\"p\">}].</span>  <span class=\"c\">%%%\n</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\">%                                               CNT       ACC       OWN\n</span><span class=\"p\">[{</span> <span class=\"s\">\"&lt;0.105.0&gt;\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>                                 <span class=\"mi\">113</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">undefined</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">259</span><span class=\"p\">}].</span>   <span class=\"c\">%%\n</span>\n<span class=\"p\">{[{</span><span class=\"n\">undefined</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>                                     <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">259</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">017</span><span class=\"p\">}],</span>\n <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">fprof</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">apply_start_stop</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>                    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">259</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">017</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>     <span class=\"c\">%\n</span> <span class=\"p\">[{{</span><span class=\"n\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">compute</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>                      <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">242</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">005</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">suspend</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>                                       <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">000</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">000</span><span class=\"p\">}]}.</span>\n\n<span class=\"p\">{[{{</span><span class=\"n\">fprof</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">apply_start_stop</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>                    <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">242</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">005</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{{</span><span class=\"n\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">compute</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>                      <span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">000</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">009</span><span class=\"p\">}],</span>\n <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">compute</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>                      <span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">242</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">014</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>     <span class=\"c\">%\n</span> <span class=\"p\">[{{</span><span class=\"n\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>                    <span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">228</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">057</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{{</span><span class=\"n\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">compute</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>                      <span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">000</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">009</span><span class=\"p\">}]}.</span>\n\n<span class=\"p\">{[{{</span><span class=\"n\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">compute</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>                      <span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">228</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">057</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{{</span><span class=\"n\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>                  <span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">000</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">163</span><span class=\"p\">}],</span>\n <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>                  <span class=\"mi\">105</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">228</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">220</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>     <span class=\"c\">%\n</span> <span class=\"p\">[{</span><span class=\"nb\">garbage_collect</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>                               <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">008</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">008</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{{</span><span class=\"n\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>                  <span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">000</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">163</span><span class=\"p\">}]}.</span>\n\n<span class=\"p\">{[{{</span><span class=\"n\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>                    <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">008</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">008</span><span class=\"p\">}],</span>\n <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"nb\">garbage_collect</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>                               <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">008</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">008</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>     <span class=\"c\">%\n</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span> <span class=\"p\">]}.</span>\n\n<span class=\"p\">{[</span> <span class=\"p\">],</span>\n <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"n\">undefined</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>                                     <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">000</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">000</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>     <span class=\"c\">%\n</span> <span class=\"p\">[{{</span><span class=\"n\">fprof</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">apply_start_stop</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>                    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">259</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">017</span><span class=\"p\">}]}.</span>\n\n<span class=\"p\">{[{{</span><span class=\"n\">fprof</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">apply_start_stop</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>                    <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">000</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">000</span><span class=\"p\">}],</span>\n <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"n\">suspend</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>                                       <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">000</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>    <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">000</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>     <span class=\"c\">%\n</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span> <span class=\"p\">]}.</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"nv\">Done</span><span class=\"o\">!</span>\n<span class=\"n\">ok</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>分析结果详细呈现了在我们的性能分析场景中执行时间都花在了哪些地方。我们可以从中了解到以下内容：</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>统计显示，在 113 次函数调用中总共消耗了约 0.259 秒的墙上时钟时间。这段时间既包括每个函数自身（“own”）的时间，也包括所有嵌套调用累加的时间。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>报告的一个关键部分会把来自递归函数的调用归到一组。注意，分析会把数据按调用层级拆分成若干分组。例如，在其中一个分组里可以看到，函数 <code>perf_example:compute/1</code> 反复调用 <code>perf_example:factorial/1</code>。具体来说，报告显示 <code>factorial/1</code> 被调用了 105 次，累计时间约 0.228 秒，自身（“own”）时间为 0.220 秒。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>这说明绝大部分处理时间都花在 <code>factorial/1</code> 上，印证了我们的怀疑：正是它反复的递归调用构成了性能瓶颈。垃圾回收所占的时间极少（约 0.008 秒），这也进一步说明繁重的计算发生在递归调用中，而不是在内存管理上。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>最后，诸如 <code>fprof:apply_start_stop/4</code> 这类函数的使用以及报告中提到的 <code>suspend</code> 调用，展示了性能分析器是如何包装我们代码的执行的。把这些细节综合起来，就得到了一幅清晰的调用图：花在 <code>compute/1</code> 上的时间主要被对 <code>factorial/1</code> 的调用消耗，而这些调用又贡献了总处理时间的大部分。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect4\"> <h5 id=\"_eprof_example\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_eprof_example\" href=\"#_eprof_example\"><code>eprof</code> 示例</a></h5> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>再来看那个变慢的应用程序：我们怀疑有一个递归函数——也就是我们那个朴素的阶乘实现——占用了大部分 CPU 时间。借助 <code>eprof</code>，我们可以用 Erlang 的 trace BIF 得到每个函数执行耗时的汇总视图。<code>eprof</code> 虽然不会像 <code>fprof</code> 那样给出完整的调用图，但能提供一份简明的、按函数划分的耗时明细。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>下面是一个示例模块，它使用 <code>eprof</code> 来对我们的递归调用进行性能分析：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"nn\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">eprof</span><span class=\"p\">().</span>\n\n<span class=\"o\">******</span> <span class=\"nv\">Process</span> <span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">108</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span>    <span class=\"o\">--</span> <span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">00</span> <span class=\"c\">% of profiled time ***\n</span><span class=\"nv\">FUNCTION</span>                          <span class=\"nv\">CALLS</span>        <span class=\"c\">%  TIME  [uS / CALLS]\n</span><span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"err\">-------                          -----  -------  ----  [----------]\n</span><span class=\"ni\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">compute</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span>                <span class=\"mi\">6</span>     <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">00</span>     <span class=\"mi\">0</span>  <span class=\"p\">[</span>      <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">00</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"nn\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">'-eprof/0-fun-0-'</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>      <span class=\"mi\">1</span>     <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">00</span>     <span class=\"mi\">0</span>  <span class=\"p\">[</span>      <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">00</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"nn\">erlang</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">apply</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span>                        <span class=\"mi\">1</span>    <span class=\"mi\">11</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">76</span>     <span class=\"mi\">2</span>  <span class=\"p\">[</span>      <span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">00</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"nn\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span>            <span class=\"mi\">105</span>    <span class=\"mi\">88</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">24</span>    <span class=\"mi\">15</span>  <span class=\"p\">[</span>      <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">14</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"err\">-------------------------------  -----  -------  ----  [----------]\nT</span><span class=\"ni\">otal</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>                              <span class=\"mi\">113</span>  <span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">00</span><span class=\"c\">%    17  [      0.15]\n</span><span class=\"n\">ok</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>报告显示共有 113 次函数调用，总共耗时 17 微秒——平均每次调用约 0.15 微秒。</p> </div> <div class=\"ulist\"> <ul> <li> <p><code>perf_example:compute/1</code> 被调用了 6 次，耗时基本上为 0 微秒，说明相对于递归工作而言，它的开销可以忽略不计。</p> </li> <li> <p>这个匿名函数（由 <code>eprof/0</code> 生成）执行了一次，没有明显的开销。</p> </li> <li> <p><code>erlang:apply/2</code> 出现一次，约占总时间的 11.76%（大约 2 微秒）。这反映了在性能分析框架内部执行该函数调用所带来的开销。</p> </li> <li> <p>主要工作量由 <code>perf_example:factorial/1</code> 承担，它被调用了 105 次，占总时间的 88.24%——累计约 15 微秒，平均每次调用约 0.14 微秒。</p> </li> </ul> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>结论：虽然对 <code>factorial/1</code> 的每次调用都极快，但它的调用次数很多，因此成了总执行时间的主要贡献者。这也印证了我们的怀疑：在这个性能分析场景中，<code>factorial/1</code> 中的递归工作才是主导因素。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect4\"> <h5 id=\"_cprof_example\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_cprof_example\" href=\"#_cprof_example\"><code>cprof</code> 示例</a></h5> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p><code>cprof</code> 工具使用断点来统计调用次数，这是一种轻量的做法，既不需要重新编译，也不需要任何跟踪消息。但它不会给出完整的调用图，也不会提供耗时信息。</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"nf\">f</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"nn\">cprof</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">start</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"nv\">Result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nn\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">compute</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">15</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">25</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">70</span><span class=\"p\">]),</span> <span class=\"nv\">PauseCount</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nn\">cprof</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">pause</span><span class=\"p\">().</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">14269</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"nv\">Analysis</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nn\">cprof</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">analyse</span><span class=\"p\">().</span>\n<span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"mi\">151</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n <span class=\"p\">[{</span><span class=\"n\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">151</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"p\">[{{</span><span class=\"n\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">},</span><span class=\"mi\">145</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n                 <span class=\"p\">{{</span><span class=\"n\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">compute</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">},</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">}]}]}</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>分析报告显示 <code>perf_example</code> 模块共有 151 次调用。其中跟踪了两个函数：</p> </div> <div class=\"ulist\"> <ul> <li> <p><code>perf_example:compute/1</code> 被调用了 6 次。</p> </li> <li> <p><code>perf_example:factorial/1</code> 被调用了 145 次。</p> </li> </ul> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>负责处理列表的 <code>compute/1</code> 函数被调用了 6 次——这与处理一个含 5 个元素的列表相符（共 6 次调用：每个递归步骤一次，再加上基准情形一次）。而繁重的工作由 <code>factorial/1</code> 承担，它被调用了 145 次。这印证了主要工作量都发生在 <code>factorial/1</code> 的递归调用中。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>数据清楚地表明，递归的阶乘函数就是热点。虽然对 <code>factorial/1</code> 的每一次调用都极快，但其调用频率很高（145 次），这说明如果它在更大的工作负载中成为瓶颈，优化这个函数就能带来性能提升。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect4\"> <h5 id=\"_tprof_example\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_tprof_example\" href=\"#_tprof_example\"><code>tprof</code> 示例</a></h5> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p><code>tprof</code> 是 OTP 27 引入的实验性统一进程性能分析工具。它支持统计调用次数、执行时间以及堆分配（<code>call_memory</code>）。在我们的场景中，我们会以 ad hoc 模式分别对每种类型使用 <code>tprof</code>，看看我们的函数在执行过程中被调用了多少次、花了多少时间，以及分配了多少内存（以字为单位）。</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"nn\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">tprof_example</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">call_count</span><span class=\"p\">).</span>\n<span class=\"nv\">FUNCTION</span>                                  <span class=\"nv\">CALLS</span>  <span class=\"p\">[</span>    <span class=\"c\">%]\n</span><span class=\"nn\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">'-tprof_example/1-fun-0-'</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>      <span class=\"mi\">1</span>  <span class=\"p\">[</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">89</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"nn\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">compute</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span>                        <span class=\"mi\">6</span>  <span class=\"p\">[</span> <span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">36</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"nn\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span>                    <span class=\"mi\">105</span>  <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">93</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">75</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n                                                 <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">ok</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"nn\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">tprof_example</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">call_time</span><span class=\"p\">).</span>\n\n<span class=\"o\">******</span> <span class=\"nv\">Process</span> <span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">129</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span>  <span class=\"o\">--</span>  <span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">00</span><span class=\"c\">% of total ***\n</span><span class=\"nv\">FUNCTION</span>                                  <span class=\"nv\">CALLS</span>  <span class=\"nv\">TIME</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">us</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>  <span class=\"nv\">PER</span> <span class=\"nv\">CALL</span>  <span class=\"p\">[</span>    <span class=\"c\">%]\n</span><span class=\"nn\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">compute</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span>                        <span class=\"mi\">6</span>          <span class=\"mi\">1</span>      <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">17</span>  <span class=\"p\">[</span> <span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">00</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"nn\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">'-tprof_example/1-fun-0-'</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>      <span class=\"mi\">1</span>          <span class=\"mi\">2</span>      <span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">00</span>  <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">00</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"nn\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span>                    <span class=\"mi\">105</span>         <span class=\"mi\">17</span>      <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">16</span>  <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">85</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">00</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n                                                        <span class=\"mi\">20</span>            <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">ok</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"nn\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">tprof_example</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">call_memory</span><span class=\"p\">).</span>\n\n<span class=\"o\">******</span> <span class=\"nv\">Process</span> <span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">132</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span>  <span class=\"o\">--</span>  <span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">00</span><span class=\"c\">% of total ***\n</span><span class=\"nv\">FUNCTION</span>                  <span class=\"nv\">CALLS</span>  <span class=\"nv\">WORDS</span>  <span class=\"nv\">PER</span> <span class=\"nv\">CALL</span>  <span class=\"p\">[</span>     <span class=\"c\">%]\n</span><span class=\"nn\">perf_example</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">factorial</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span>    <span class=\"mi\">105</span>     <span class=\"mi\">51</span>      <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">49</span>  <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">00</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n                                    <span class=\"mi\">51</span>            <span class=\"p\">[</span> <span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">ok</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p><code>call_count</code> 的分析结果显示，匿名包装函数被调用 1 次（0.89%），<code>compute/1</code> 被调用 6 次（5.36%），而繁重的工作由 <code>factorial/1</code> 承担，它被调用 105 次（93.75%）。这与我们的预期相符：大多数调用（因而也是主要工作量）都发生在递归的 <code>factorial/1</code> 函数中。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p><code>call_time</code> 的输出表明，<code>compute/1</code> 在 6 次调用中总共耗时 1 微秒（每次调用约 0.17 µs），匿名函数耗时 2 µs，而 <code>factorial/1</code> 在 105 次调用中耗时 17 µs（每次调用约 0.16 µs）。虽然单次调用的时间都很短，但累计时间仍显示 <code>factorial/1</code> 占总执行时间的大部分（85%），进一步说明它才是计算工作的主要发生地。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p><code>call_memory</code> 的分析结果指出，所测得的全部堆分配（共 51 字）都发生在 <code>factorial/1</code> 中，而它被调用了 105 次。换算下来每次调用约分配 0.49 字。由于 <code>compute/1</code> 和匿名包装函数都没有被归入任何内存分配，这证实了该工作负载中的内存开销完全来自这个递归函数。</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>"}